Package: attack-surface
Version: 0.11.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-requests, python3-dnspython, python3-yaml, nmap
Recommends: openssl
Suggests: wapiti, nikto
Maintainer: Mahdi Khaligh <khalighmahdi@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Modular attack-surface reconnaissance and blue-team monitoring
 Discovers and grades the external attack surface of a domain:
 subdomain discovery, nmap -sV service banners, security-header auditing,
 technology fingerprinting, CDN/origin detection, admin-panel discovery,
 exposed CMS setup pages, subdomain-takeover fingerprints, baseline
 diffing for continuous monitoring, CPE-exact CVE watchlists (NVD) and
 safe active checks (TLS audit, login liveness, DNS AXFR/DNSSEC).
 Exports XSS-safe HTML, CSV, Markdown, JSON; streams CEF syslog,
 Slack and Telegram alerts.
 .
 Home-page: https://github.com/khalighmahdi/attack-surface
Tag: role::program, security::recon, implemented-in::python, interface::commandline
